# Throwaway probe scripts and their output. Under ./tmp rather than /tmp because
# ts-node resolves against rootDir; kept out of git because each one answers a
# single question about live data and is worthless the day after.
tmp/

data/policy/
policy/history/

# The IBKR-mode data directory — the same runtime files as data/ (journal, fills,
# LESSONS, state, sectors, policy) from a run against TWS. Live trading records, so
# ignored for the same reason its data/ counterparts above are. The files stay on disk;
# the copies already in history are untouched by this.
#
# Kept ignored so `DATA_DIR=./ibkr-data` works without further edits. Any OTHER DATA_DIR is
# covered by neither this line nor the data/ lines above — if you point one inside the repo,
# add it here too.
ibkr-data/

# Local agent/tool scratch, never shared. `.claude/settings local.json` was tracked and
# carried a live ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN and an internal base URL into a PUBLIC repo (added
# in a446713); `.bob/` holds a generated architecture HTML that is a build artifact of a
# conversation, not a source file. Ignoring the directories, not just those two paths, so
# the next local settings file or artifact does not repeat it. If a SHARED .claude config
# is ever wanted, un-ignore it explicitly (`!.claude/settings.json`) — never the *.local.*
# variants, which is where credentials land.
.claude/
.bob/
